          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላለው ፡ ኢይትዓፀው ፡ አናቅጽኪ ፡ ወኢይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጸልም ፡ ወርኅኪ ፡ ወለኪሰ ፡ ለሊሁ ፡እግ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዚአብሔር ፡ ውእቱ ፡ ብርሃንኪ ፡ ብለው።",
